---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Waitlist from '../components/Waitlist.astro';
---

<Base title="GenATK — Generative Asset Toolkit" description="Independent studies in deterministic, local-first procedural generation for game assets.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> Independent procedural studies</p>
      <h1>Build worlds from rules.<br /><em>Keep the proof.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">GenATK explores a quieter kind of procedural generation: variations that can be named, revisited, inspected, and carried into a real production conversation.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/labs/seeded-assets/">Enter Wayfinder Lab <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/research/">Read our research standard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <dl class="hero-proof" aria-label="GenATK principles">
        <div><dt>Seeded</dt><dd>every variation has a return path</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Inspectable</dt><dd>inputs are part of the artifact</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Local-minded</dt><dd>workflows stay close to the project</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stage" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="stage-topline"><span>WAYFINDER SIGNAL</span><span>01 / PUBLIC</span></div>
      <div class="stage-grid"></div>
      <div class="stage-disc disc-one"></div><div class="stage-disc disc-two"></div>
      <div class="stage-monolith"><i></i><b></b><span></span></div>
      <div class="stage-coordinate">48° 08′ 00″ N<br />017° 06′ 00″ E</div>
      <div class="stage-footer"><span>RULE / FORM / REVIEW</span><span>GENATK</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <p class="eyebrow">A more useful kind of variation</p>
    <p class="manifesto-statement">Not a content factory. A set of instruments for making generative work <em>legible, revisitable, and useful</em> to the people who have to ship it.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="principles">
    <article><span>01 / IDENTITY</span><h2>Name the variation.</h2><p>When a result has an identity, feedback can refer to a specific thing—not a moving target.</p></article>
    <article><span>02 / CONTROL</span><h2>Keep the input visible.</h2><p>Seeds, settings, and revisions make a generated result discussable long after its first preview.</p></article>
    <article><span>03 / CRAFT</span><h2>Leave room for judgment.</h2><p>Repeatability makes review more concrete. It does not remove the artistic decision.</p></article>
  </section>

  <section class="featured">
    <div class="featured-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured instrument / 01</p>
      <h2>A landmark you can interrogate.</h2>
      <p>The Wayfinder is a public Three.js study. Choose a form, set a seed, then inspect the structural identity separately from its appearance.</p>
      <a class="arrow-link" href="/labs/seeded-assets/">Open the interactive study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <a class="instrument-card" href="/labs/seeded-assets/" aria-label="Open Wayfinder Lab">
      <div class="instrument-grid"></div>
      <div class="instrument-object"><i></i><b></b><strong></strong><span></span></div>
      <div class="instrument-meta"><span>WAYFINDER / 01</span><span>LIVE STUDY</span></div>
      <div class="instrument-readout"><span>SEED</span><strong>004287</strong><span>FORM</span><strong>SHRINE</strong></div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="home-resources">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Field notes</p><h2>Useful before the toolkit exists.</h2></div>
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <a href="/learn/reproducible-procedural-assets/"><span>LEARN / 01</span><strong>Why reproducible assets are easier to review.</strong><em>Read the note <b>→</b></em></a>
      <a href="/research/asset-review-record/"><span>RESEARCH / 02</span><strong>A lightweight record for generated assets.</strong><em>Use the worksheet <b>→</b></em></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-waitlist">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Stay near the work</p><h2>Early notes,<br />not launch noise.</h2><p>Join the small list for public labs, technical notes, and a clear first look when there is something real to show.</p></div>
    <Waitlist source="homepage" />
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .home-hero, .manifesto, .principles, .featured, .home-resources, .home-waitlist { width: min(100%, 78rem); margin: auto; padding-inline: clamp(1.15rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); }
  .home-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .92fr) minmax(25rem, 1.08fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-items: center; min-height: min(48rem, calc(100vh - 4.5rem)); padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .hero-copy h1 { max-width: 9ch; margin: .8rem 0 1.3rem; font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 7.5vw, 7.35rem); line-height: .91; letter-spacing: -.072em; }
  .hero-copy h1 em { color: var(--lime); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }
  .pulse { display: inline-block; width: .48rem; height: .48rem; margin-right: .56rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--lime); box-shadow: 0 0 1rem var(--lime); vertical-align: .08em; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2.1rem; } .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; } .text-link { color: var(--text); font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; } .text-link span, .arrow-link span { color: var(--lime); margin-left: .25rem; }
  .hero-proof { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .9rem; max-width: 38rem; margin: 3.1rem 0 0; } .hero-proof div { padding-top: .8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } .hero-proof dt { font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; } .hero-proof dd { margin: .22rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .hero-stage { position: relative; min-height: clamp(27rem, 45vw, 38rem); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #36404e; border-radius: 1.35rem; background: radial-gradient(circle at 48% 43%, #263a47 0, #121b25 38%, #090c12 74%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 8rem #02030599, 0 2rem 5rem #0006; isolation: isolate; }
  .stage-grid { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(#c6f3e40a 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #c6f3e40a 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 2.25rem 2.25rem; mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000, transparent 95%); } .stage-topline, .stage-footer { position: absolute; z-index: 3; right: 1rem; left: 1rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #cde2e688; font-size: .64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; } .stage-topline { top: 1rem; } .stage-footer { bottom: 1rem; } .stage-coordinate { position: absolute; z-index: 3; right: 1rem; bottom: 3rem; color: #cde2e655; font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .08em; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right; }
  .stage-disc { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; border: 1px solid #b9f1e655; border-radius: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotateX(69deg) rotateZ(-27deg); } .disc-one { width: 70%; height: 70%; box-shadow: 0 0 3rem #a6f0c522; } .disc-two { width: 42%; height: 42%; border-color: #d5ff8655; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotateX(68deg) rotateZ(38deg); }
  .stage-monolith { position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 30%; height: 59%; transform: translate(-50%, -44%); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 1.9rem #c8ff8233); } .stage-monolith::before { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(111deg, #d7ff91 0 21%, #91ce76 21% 41%, #345845 41% 68%, #1c2d2b 68%); clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 27%, 83% 100%, 18% 100%, 0 27%); content: ''; } .stage-monolith i { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 12%; left: 50%; width: 34%; aspect-ratio: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg); background: #efffc4; box-shadow: 0 0 2rem #d8ff83; } .stage-monolith b { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 58%; left: 17%; width: 66%; height: 1px; background: #e6ffb5aa; box-shadow: 0 0 .8rem #e6ffb5; } .stage-monolith span { position: absolute; z-index: 1; right: 18%; bottom: 15%; width: .42rem; height: .42rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #10151b; box-shadow: 0 0 0 .18rem #eaffba; }
  .manifesto { padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } .manifesto-statement { max-width: 23ch; margin: .85rem 0 0; color: var(--text); font: 500 clamp(2.25rem, 5.2vw, 5rem)/.98 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.055em; } .manifesto-statement em { color: var(--mint); font-style: italic; }
  .principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--line); } .principles article { min-height: 18rem; padding: 1.55rem; background: var(--panel); } .principles span, .resource-grid span { color: var(--lime); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; } .principles h2 { max-width: 9ch; margin: 3rem 0 .75rem; font: 500 2rem/.96 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.04em; } .principles p { max-width: 28ch; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .featured { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .86fr 1.14fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 7rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10rem); } .featured h2, .home-resources h2, .home-waitlist h2 { max-width: 10ch; margin: .55rem 0 1.1rem; font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5vw, 4.85rem); line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -.06em; } .featured-copy p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 34rem; color: var(--muted); } .arrow-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .instrument-card { position: relative; display: block; min-height: 31rem; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #3a4658; border-radius: 1.25rem; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%, #304552, #121b24 50%, #0a0d13); color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; box-shadow: inset 0 0 6rem #020306aa, 0 1.8rem 4rem #0004; } .instrument-grid { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(#c5f7e310 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #c5f7e310 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 2rem 2rem; } .instrument-meta { position: absolute; z-index: 2; inset: 1rem 1rem auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #d6e6e299; font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .12em; } .instrument-object { position: absolute; top: 48%; left: 50%; width: 30%; height: 59%; transform: translate(-50%, -45%); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 2rem #d6ff8b44); } .instrument-object::before { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(111deg, #d7ff91 0 21%, #8ac876 21% 41%, #3a5d49 41% 68%, #172723 68%); clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 28%, 83% 100%, 18% 100%, 0 28%); content: ''; } .instrument-object i { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 13%; left: 50%; width: 31%; aspect-ratio: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg); background: #f1ffc9; box-shadow: 0 0 2rem #d8ff83; } .instrument-object b { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 60%; left: 17%; width: 66%; height: 1px; background: #ecffc2; } .instrument-object strong { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 22%; left: 32%; width: 36%; height: 1px; background: #1f442d; transform: rotate(-45deg); } .instrument-object span { position: absolute; z-index: 1; right: 19%; bottom: 15%; width: .43rem; height: .43rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #111a1b; box-shadow: 0 0 0 .17rem #eaffba; } .instrument-readout { position: absolute; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto; gap: .15rem .65rem; color: #dce9e5aa; font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .1em; } .instrument-readout strong { color: #e9f6f0; font-size: .7rem; } .instrument-card::after { position: absolute; right: 50%; bottom: 10%; left: 7%; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #c8f6c366, transparent); content: ''; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .home-resources { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: 2rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 2rem; } .home-resources h2 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.8rem); } .resource-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--line); } .resource-grid a { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 17rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s ease; } .resource-grid a:hover { background: #19212d; } .resource-grid strong { max-width: 11ch; margin: 2.8rem 0 auto; font: 500 1.65rem/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.035em; } .resource-grid em { color: var(--lime); font-size: .82rem; font-style: normal; } .resource-grid em b { margin-left: .25rem; }
  .home-waitlist { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 7rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem); } .home-waitlist h2 { color: var(--lime); } .home-waitlist p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 35ch; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 54rem) { .home-hero, .featured, .home-resources, .home-waitlist { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .home-hero { min-height: auto; padding-top: 3.5rem; } .hero-stage { max-width: 43rem; width: 100%; margin: auto; } .featured { padding-block: 6rem; } .home-resources { gap: .5rem; } } @media (max-width: 40rem) { .hero-copy h1 { font-size: 3.75rem; } .hero-proof, .principles, .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .principles article { min-height: 0; } .principles h2 { margin-top: 1.5rem; } .instrument-card { min-height: 25rem; } .resource-grid a { min-height: 12rem; } .resource-grid strong { margin-top: 1.5rem; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .pulse { animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; } .disc-one { animation: drift 12s linear infinite; } .disc-two { animation: drift-reverse 9s linear infinite; } .instrument-object { animation: hover 5s ease-in-out infinite; } } @keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity: .45; box-shadow: 0 0 .3rem var(--lime); } } @keyframes drift { to { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotateX(69deg) rotateZ(333deg); } } @keyframes drift-reverse { to { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotateX(68deg) rotateZ(-322deg); } } @keyframes hover { 50% { transform: translate(-50%, -49%); } }
</style>
